Viewers of Isencane Lengane applauded Thando Dlamuka for defending her mother, Ntombikayise Msomi, during a recent episode of the popular reality show on Moja Love.

THANDO DLAMUKA PRAISED FOR DEFENDING HER MOTHER

In this episode, Thando met with her two mothers-in-law, MaShange and MaMkhize, to confront them about their disrespectful behaviour towards her mother.

Some of the insults hurled at Ntombikayise included being called derogatory names and facing judgement for not being married.



MaShange admitted to insulting Thando’s mother but explained that she had retaliated after Ntombikayise allegedly said some hurtful remarks about her late husband, Bab’ Dlamuka.

